<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="600" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><br></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Dear
<span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[BPL Name]</span>,<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">**Add
personal introduction**</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I
am excited to help you save lives at your blood drive next week. I wanted to
make sure you felt prepared to have a successful drive – please see some
reminders below to help you make that happen. You currently have <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">XXX</span> online appointments.
Are all of the appointments added online, or do you also have some on a paper
schedule? If you do, let’s get those added online so we don’t have any
overbooking.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Drive
Logistics Reminders:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Goal:
<b><span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">XXX</span> units</b>,
Sign Up Goal: <b><span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">XXX</span>
donors</b>.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Number of Power Red Machines: <span style="background:yellow;
mso-highlight:yellow">X</span>!</span></b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> These count 2 towards your goal, so please
make a special effort to recruit these. The blood types needed are O-, O+, A-
and B-. Men (5'1” AND 130 lbs.) Women (5'3” AND 150 lbs.). <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Supervisor:
<span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Name]</span>. They are
one of your regular team supervisors, so I'm sure you'll recognize them. <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[add personal information to
give confidence to the team]</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Staff
will arrive at <b><span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[time]</span></b>.
Please have the room unlocked, and the AC turned down to 68 degrees upon
arrival so there is no delay in setting up.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Please
ensure the donation site is clear (including parking spots) and the appropriate
number (per your planning guide) of tables and chairs are set up in the space
before the staff arrives. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Have
a paper copy of the schedule available for staff.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Recruiting
Reminders:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Recruit
</span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/donate-blood/how-to-donate/common-concerns/first-time-donors.html"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">First Time Donors</span></a><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">: Ask your current
appointments to bring a friend. Use the </span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/hosting-a-blood-drive/manage-my-blood-drive/blood-drive-coordinator-toolkit/tips-tools-for-recruiting-donors/coordinator-toolkit---tips-and-tools.html"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">BPL resources for tips
and tricks</span></a><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Call or email all donors 1-2 days before your blood drive
to remind of appointments.</span></b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Please
inform donors about </span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/donate-blood/manage-my-donations/rapidpass.html"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">RapidPass</span></b></a><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">, which allows you to
start the blood donation process from the comfort of your home or office and
save time at the donation site. RapidPass must be completed on the day of the
drive!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Encourage
donors to schedule their next appt before leaving the blood drive either
through the <b>Book Now App</b> or a personal device via the Blood Donor App.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:red">***Use For High School Drives***<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Recruiting
Reminders:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Keep
me informed of appointment counts more often than not throughout the process.
The more I know, the more I can try to find more staff for you if needed!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Encourage
all 16-year-old donors to turn in their parent consent before signing up. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Refer
to the height and weight chart while recruiting. Don't sign up students who do
not meet these requirements.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Remind
donors to eat a good breakfast/lunch, drink plenty of water and bring a form of
picture ID with them to the drive.<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Make
     sure to have the students complete the hall passes for about 5 minutes
     before their appointment, so students arrive on time. Students arriving at
     their appointment time helps to decrease wait times drastically!<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Please
inform donors about <b>RapidPass</b>, which allows you to start the blood
donation process from the comfort of your home or office and save time at the
donation site. RapidPass must be completed on the day of the drive!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Encourage
donors to schedule their next appt before leaving the blood drive either
through the <b>Book Now App</b> or a personal device via the Blood Donor App.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:red">******<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">For
help with online scheduling or login information, please contact customer care
at 1-855-210-1278 (or </span><a href="mailto:customercare@redcross.org"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">customercare@redcross.org</span></a><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">) from 8:30 a.m. to 9
p.m. ET to assist you. Additional tools for as a Blood Program Leader are
available at </span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/hosting-a-blood-drive/manage-my-blood-drive/blood-drive-coordinator-toolkit.html"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">RedCrossBlood.org</span></a><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> and your BPL portal.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Thank
you for your help in recruiting donors and planning for this blood drive!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Best regards,</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Name]<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Title]<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader">













































































</p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Email]<o:p></o:p></span></p><p></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
